INCLUDE GlobalDialogueData.ink

==moreThanFive
=died1
#speaker: Athena
What do you think is the most valuable thing you can lose in gambling?

#speaker: Apistos
My... honor?

#speaker: Athena
WRONG! BRAIN CELLS! And you’ve excelled at losing those.

#speaker: Apistos
It’s not like I gambled that much… just {totalGamblingAttempts} times.

#speaker: Athena
And each time, another wrinkle vanished from your brain.

#speaker: Apistos
So rude… Should I cry about it?

#speaker: Athena
Save the tears for your opponents! MOVE OUT—NO MORE GAMBLING!
->DONE
=died2
#speaker: Athena
We have this... ridiculous rule on Olympus. Honestly, it's absurd.

#speaker: Apistos
Oh? Do enlighten me.

#speaker: Athena
If Dionysus tricks you three times, you become his personal slave. Feeding him grapes. For eternity.

#speaker: Apistos
Pfft. That's the dumbest thing I've heard—and I've heard a lot. You gods have zero sense of humor.

#speaker: Athena 
...

#speaker: Apistos
...Wait. That is a joke, right?

#speaker: Athena
...

#speaker: Apistos
Oh come on—I need to prepare, don't I?

#speaker: Athena
...

#speaker: Apistos
SAY SOMETHING! I refuse to be a grape-butler! ATHENA! //ask about goto dionysus fate
->DONE

==lessThanFive
=died1
#speaker: Athena
Well? Anything interesting happen?

#speaker: Apistos
I lost money gambling!

#speaker: Athena
At least you're honest about it.

#speaker: Apistos
I never hold back honest answers—haven’t you noticed?

#speaker: Athena
Sometimes I think you confuse "honesty" with "being needlessly rude."

#speaker: Apistos
What’s that supposed to mean?

#speaker: Athena
Must I spell it out? You use "brutal honesty" as an excuse to be pointlessly harsh.

#speaker: Apistos
If everyone around me is a complete idiot, that’s their fault, not mine.

#speaker: Athena
Go try that "honesty" on Zeus—see what happens!
->DONE
=died2
#speaker: Apistos
...

#speaker: Athena
Why so quiet? Swallow a fish?

#speaker: Apistos
How long were you saving that joke?

#speaker: Athena
Way too long... So? Any news?

#speaker: Apistos
I lost at gambling again...

#speaker: Athena
And here I thought you'd surprise me!

#speaker: Apistos
Was that... an insult? I feel like I should be offended.

#speaker: Athena
By all means, be offended, my little guppy! But let’s face it—luck’s never been on your side.

#speaker: Apistos
Well... Especially when I met you.

#speaker: Athena
Nonsense! Meeting me was the only lucky day of your miserable life!

#speaker: Apistos
Wow... The ego on you... I'm both amazed and slightly wounded.

#speaker: Athena
No time for pouting! Forward, my champion!
->DONE